7+13. Describe reaction(s): Grade {{ ae.grade }} {{ ae.term }}{% if ae.serious %}; criterion: required or prolonged hospitalisation{% endif %}. {% if ae.resolved %}Recovered on {{ event_date(ae.resolved, alt="a later date") }}.{% else %}Not yet recovered at the time of this report.{% endif %}

{{ section("II. Suspect Drug Information") }}
14. Suspect drug: {{ compound(study) }} film-coated tablets, oral, once daily
